      "disposition": "ALL_SUCCESS_AND_COPY_FAULT_PATHS_UNLOCK",
      "details": "The two ioctl copy commands each acquire the same frame mutex at tcm+0x470. Both converge on a shared completion path that unlocks for successful copy_to_user and for a copy fault. The 8 Joern entries represent 4 unique source call sites because each site appears in two cast/type spellings. The probe initializes this mutex at +0x470 before misc_register exposes the file operations.",
